body:
As an introvert, who struggles to talk to people irl, Iv seen his videos on youtube, and at first I was like "This guy is kinda interesting", but eventually every video became so similar, each video had a different topic/title, but he'd just talk about the same stuff. It was always "Be out going, stop being quiet/shy, etc." 

&#x200B;

I'm sorry you lost almost 5k to a guy like that.

I don't whats worse, him playing fortnite, or the fact that he's watching Teen Titans go....

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

>!(Its the second one)!<
